270 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 703 0 R
/E ( Gender-Based Violence \(GBV\):Gender-based violence against women is defined as violence directed at a woman simply because she is a woman, or violence that disproportionately affects women. Violence against women involves the intimidation of women through the use of physical force or threats, and encompasses a wide range of harmful behaviors directed at women and girls due to their gender.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
