/E ( Digital or Cyber Gender-Based Violence: Digital or cyber gender-based violence is a human rights violation in which individuals are targeted, intimidated, manipulated, or abused via digital tools and online platforms based on their gender, gender identity, or sexual orientation. It is a reflection of offline inequalities and power dynamics in the virtual environment.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
