1307 0 obj
<<
/Title (A major impediment to eradicating gender-based violence \(GBV\) is the presence of inadequate legal frameworks and the widespread impunity enjoyed by perpetrators. In various legal systems globally, existing laws fail to explicitly criminalize all forms of violence, including marital rape, domestic abuse, and digital harassment. Furthermore, legislative ambiguity, outdated statutory definitions, and conflicting customary or religious practices often dilute formal legal protections, leaving survivors without effective recourse)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1305 0 R
/Next 1309 0 R
>>
endobj
